[
  {
    "id": "c001",
    "name": "Definitions – Customer",
    "text": "In this Agreement, the words “Customer,” “Buyer,” \"you\" and \"your\" mean the person that is identified under the heading “Customer” above."
  },
  {
    "id": "c002",
    "name": "Definitions – Seller",
    "text": "The words “Seller,” “we,\" \"us,\" and “our” mean PLS Loan Store of Texas, Inc., a licensed Texas Credit Access Business (“CAB\"), operating pursuant to Chapter 393 of the Texas Finance Code (“Chapter 393”),"
  },
  {
    "id": "c003",
    "name": "Definitions – Lender",
    "text": "The lender from whom the extension of consumer credit is obtained is DSI Lending Resources, Inc,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c004",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Status",
    "text": "Description of Our Services: We are not a lender or fiduciary."
  },
  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Core services",
    "text": "For the CAB fee set forth below, we will attempt to (1) obtain a loan in the amount and for the term set forth below from DSI Lending Resources, Inc., a third party lender, with a contract rate of interest of no more than ten percent per annum (10%); (2) issue a letter of credit (“LOC”) to secure that loan; and (3) assist you in preparing and completing documents necessary to obtain the loan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c006",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Performance period",
    "text": "The estimated period for performing these services shall be one day,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Additional services",
    "text": "Additionally, we will also attempt to: (4) assist you in creating a positive credit history, if requested, through routine reporting of your payments to an allernative consumer reporting agency; (5) assist you in making your payments timely by providing a reminder service; (6) upon request, provide consumer financial cducation materials; (7) where available, provide discounted check cashing services to facilitate payment(s); and (8) maintain a network of branch locations to provide certain CAB services."
  },
  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Additional-services term",
    "text": "These additional services may be provided throughout the term,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c009",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – No loan promise",
    "text": "We do not promise that you will actually receive a loan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c010",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Credit decisions",
    "text": "All credit decisions shall be made by a third party lender."
  },
  {
    "id": "c011",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Denied application fee",
    "text": "HOWEVER, YOU WILL NOT OWE US A FEE IP YOUR LOAN APPLICATION IS DENIED BY THE LENDER,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c012",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Finance-charge amount",
    "text": "The precise amount of your finance charge will depend upon the amount that the lender allows you to borrow, and the term of the loan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c013",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Alternative credit",
    "text": "You have been advised that our CAB services and the third party loan, if any, you receive may not be at the lowest rate or vest terms available, and that you may look elsewhere for credit services and a loan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c014",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Collection-law compliance",
    "text": "A credit access business must comply with Chapter 392 and the federal Fair Debt Collection Practices Act (15 U.S.C. Section 1692 et seq.) with respect to an extension of consumer credit described by Section 393.602(a)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c015",
    "name": "Description of Our Services – Military-law compliance",
    "text": "A credit access business must comply, to the extent applicable, with 10 U.S.C. Section 987 and any regulations adopted under that law with respect to an cxtension of consumer eredit described by Section 393.602(a)."
  },
  {
    "id": "c016",
    "name": "Disclosure of Fee as Finance Charge",
    "text": "Disclosure of Fee as Finance Charge: Although the fee that we charge you is not interest, the Federal Trath in Lending Act requires that it be included in the finance charge calculation for your loan."
  },
  {
    "id": "c017",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – CAB fee rate",
    "text": "COST AND PAYMENT TERMS. Our CAB fee is based upon 708.90% annualized rate on the amount finaneed on the loan to you by the Lender,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c018",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – CAB fee payment",
    "text": "Our CAB fee is due when the loan is made and is financed as part of the loan to you from the Lender,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c019",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – Amount financed",
    "text": "On the payday installment loan of $300.00 you have applied for, payable in LO payments with interest of 10.00% per annum charged by the Lender, the Amount Financed is 300,00,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c020",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – Finance charge",
    "text": "the Pinance Charge is $561.15."
  },
  {
    "id": "c021",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – Finance-charge composition",
    "text": "The Finanee Charge consists of the interest paid or to be paid to the Lender, in the amount of $3.00 and our CAB fee for this transaction of $556.15."
  },
  {
    "id": "c022",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – APR and payments",
    "text": "‘The Annual Percentage Rate is 713.38%, payments commencing on 4/20/2012, in the amount of $86.15, Followed by regular bi-weekly payments of $86.15 each, with a final payment of $85.80 on 8/24/2012, and the Total of Payments is $86.15."
  },
  {
    "id": "c023",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – CAB fee refund",
    "text": "You will be entitled to a refund of part of the CAB fee based on a prorated daily basis for the final period with respect to payment in full or acceleration of maturity."
  },
  {
    "id": "c024",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – Early payoff",
    "text": "Under any loan that we may abtain for you, if you pay off your loan early, you will not have to pay a penalty and your finance charge may be reduced."
  },
  {
    "id": "c025",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – No prepayment penalty",
    "text": "There is no prepayment penalty,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c026",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – CAB reimbursement and fees",
    "text": "Besides the CAB fees, you are responsible to reimburse CAB for any amounts CAB pays the Lender on the letter of credit, plus 10% per annum until (he reimbursement is paid, a return item fee of $30 for any check, ACH debit, electronic check, or other payment device that is returned unpaid, attorneys’ fees, and costs of collection,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c027",
    "name": "Cost and Payment Terms – Lender fees",
    "text": "Besides interest to the Lender, you would be responsible to the Lender for a late charge equal to the greater of 5% or $7.50, if payment is 10 or more days late, a return item {ce of $30 for any check, ACH debit, electronic check, or other payment device that is returned unpaid, and attorneys! fees, and costs of collection,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c028",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – LOC request",
    "text": "juest us to issue our irrevocable LOC in favor of the third party lender as beneficiary in accordance with LOC and Obligation to Reimburse: You rec licable, on Chapter $ of the Texas Business and Commerce Code, in an amount not to exceed principal, interest, returned item fee, and late fee, as app the loan that we arrange for you."
  },
  {
    "id": "c029",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Reimbursement",
    "text": "You agree fo pay us any amounts paid by us to third parties pursuant to the LOC."
  },
  {
    "id": "c030",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Presentment conditions",
    "text": "Our payment on the LOC to the lender is conditioned upon presentnent by the lender to us of(a) the lender's sight draft, and (b) the lender's statement that your loan is in default and hag been in default at least 10 days from its due date."
  },
  {
    "id": "c031",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Expiration",
    "text": "The LOC will expire the earlier of 55 days after maturity of the loan we arrange for you or the date the loan is paid in full,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c032",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Cancellation",
    "text": "If you timely exercise your right to cancel this Agreement, our LOC shall be automatically revoked and shal! have no further effect."
  },
  {
    "id": "c033",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Sight draft",
    "text": "You instruct us to pay the lender’s sight draft up to the maximum amount of the LOC upon presentation to us of documentation complying with the conditions set forth above."
  },
  {
    "id": "c034",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Document review",
    "text": "You understand that we are nol responsible for determining the accuracy of any statement made by the lender/ LOC beneficiary and that our duty is strictly to pay upon proper presentment of documents."
  },
  {
    "id": "c035",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Lawful amounts",
    "text": "No part of this Agreement, nor any charge or receipt by us, is intended to permit us to Impose any amount in excess of lawful amounts."
  },
  {
    "id": "c036",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Unlawful excess",
    "text": "If an unlawful excess occurs, we will apply if as a credit or otherwise refund if and (he rate or amount involved will automatically be reduced to the maximum lawful rate or amount,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c037",
    "name": "LOC and Obligation to Reimburse – Charge calculation",
    "text": "To the extent permitted by law, for purposes of determining our compliance with law, we may calculate charges by amortizing, prorating, allocating or spreading."
  },
  {
    "id": "c038",
    "name": "Default – Definition",
    "text": "DEFAULT: You will be in default under th4+-Agreement if (1) you do not pay us what you owe yr~ader this Agreement on or before the payment date; (2) if you fail to perform your other promis: us; or (3) you fail to perform your obligations tot! ander,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c039",
    "name": "Default – Acceleration",
    "text": "[you default, your obligations, less any uncarned charges, will become immediately due and payable,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c040",
    "name": "Default – Collection of security",
    "text": "(1) we shall have the right to seck collection of any check or similar security you have provided us;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c041",
    "name": "Default – Other remedies",
    "text": "(2) we may exercise any other right or remedy allowed by law and this Agreement,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c042",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Notice waiver",
    "text": "NOTICES AND WAIVERS; Except for aotices provided in this Agreement, you, and others responsible, to the extent permitted by law, waive demand, notice of nonpayment, notice of intention to accelerate, notice of acceleration, presentment, and notice of dishonor,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c043",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Delayed enforcement",
    "text": "we may waive or delay enforcing our rights without losing them;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c044",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Collection diligence",
    "text": "we are not required to file suit or arbitrate, show diligence in collection against you or others responsible, or go against any collateral;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c045",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Release or modification",
    "text": "we may release or modify any person's liability without changing the liability of others;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c046",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Collateral",
    "text": "we may substitute, exchange or release any collateral;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c047",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Parties to proceedings",
    "text": "we may sue or arbitrate with one or more persons without joining or suing others;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c048",
    "name": "Notices and Waivers – Renewal or extension",
    "text": "we may renew or extend the obligations owed to us as often and for so long as we desire without notice to or approval by others responsible."
  },
  {
    "id": "c049",
    "name": "Waiver of Right to Trial by Jury – Acknowledgment",
    "text": "WAIVER OF RIGHT TO TRIAL BY JURY: You acknowledge that there is a constitutional right to trial by jury but it may be waived under certain circumstances,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c050",
    "name": "Waiver of Right to Trial by Jury – Waiver",
    "text": "To the extent permitted by law, you, us, and Lender, knowingly and voluntarily waive any right to trial by jury in the event of litigation arising out of or related to this Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c051",
    "name": "Waiver of Right to Trial by Jury – Arbitration agreement",
    "text": "This jury trial waiver shall not affect or be interpreted as modifying in any fashion the Jury Trial Waiver and Arbitration Agreement if you do not reject that Jury Trial Waiver and Arbitration Agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c052",
    "name": "Compliance – Intent",
    "text": "COMPLIANCE: It is the intention of CAB and Lender to comply with applicable law."
  },
  {
    "id": "c053",
    "name": "Compliance – Rights limited by law",
    "text": "In cach and every instance, CAB’s and Lender's respective rights are limited by applicable law (fo the extent they may not be lawfully waived), construed so as to comply with applicable laws, and CAB's and Lender's rights may not be exercised except to the extent permitted by applicable law,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c054",
    "name": "Compliance – Lawful charges",
    "text": "No charge or receipt by CAB or Lender, or any other person on CAB's or Lender's behalf, is intended to exceed lawful amounts,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c055",
    "name": "Compliance – Unlawful excess",
    "text": "[fan unlawful excess occurs, it will be applied as a credit or otherwise refunded, and the rate or amount involved wil! automatically be reduced to the maximum lawful rale or amount,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c056",
    "name": "Compliance – Charge calculation",
    "text": "To the extent permitted by law, for purposes of determining CAB’s and Lender’s compliance with the law, CAB and Lender may calculate charges by amortizing, prorating, allocating and spreading."
  },
  {
    "id": "c057",
    "name": "Pre-Suit Notice – Notice and cure",
    "text": "PRE-SUIT NOTICE REGARDING LEGAL COMPLIANCE: Prior to initiating any claim that this agreement or related maticr, or any action or inaction by us or Lender, or by any other person, is legally non-compliant, illegal or unenforceable, you must provide us and Lender with detailed written notice of the claim and relief requested and a reasonable opportunity of not [ess than 60 days to cure the claim."
  },
  {
    "id": "c058",
    "name": "Pre-Suit Notice – Delivery",
    "text": "Any notice to us or to Lender must be sent by certified mail, return receipt requested, to PLS Loan Store of Texas, Inc,, Attn, Legal Department, 300 North Elizabeth, 4th Floor, Chicago, IL. 60607,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c059",
    "name": "Pre-Suit Notice – Corrective action",
    "text": "Any corrective action shall relieve us and Lender of any liability to the extent permitted by law,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c060",
    "name": "Pre-Suit Notice – Cumulative requirement",
    "text": "To the extent permitted by law, this requirement for pre-suit notice is cumulative of any notices and corrective-action procedures required by applicable flaw and other contract provisions,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c061",
    "name": "Collection Expenses – Attorneys’ fees and costs",
    "text": "Collection Expenses: You agree to pay our reasonable attorneys’ fees if this Agreement is referred to an attorney for collection, regardless of whether legal proceedings are actually filed, and all costs and disbursements."
  },
  {
    "id": "c062",
    "name": "Collection Expenses – Criminal-charge threats",
    "text": "A person may not threaten or pursuc criminal charges against you related to a check or other debit authorization provided by the consumer as sccurity for a loan, in the absence of forgery, fraud, theft, or other criminal conduct."
  },
  {
    "id": "c063",
    "name": "Interstate Commerce",
    "text": "Interstate Commerce: You agree that this Agreement involves interstate commerce for all purposes."
  },
  {
    "id": "c064",
    "name": "Assignment – CAB transfer",
    "text": "Assignment: We may transfer any of our rights, titles and interests under this Agrcement at our discretion."
  },
  {
    "id": "c065",
    "name": "Assignment – Customer transfer",
    "text": "You may not transfer your rights under this Agreement without our prior written consent."
  },
  {
    "id": "c066",
    "name": "Miscellaneous – Principal place of business",
    "text": "Miscellaneous: Our principal place of business is PLS Loan Store of Texas, Inc., 300 North Elizabeth, 4th Floor, Chicago, IL 60607."
  },
  {
    "id": "c067",
    "name": "Miscellaneous – Process agent",
    "text": "Our agent in ‘Texas authorized to receive service of process is: National Registered Agents, Inc., 16053 Space Center Bivd., Suite 235, Houston, ‘Texas 77062."
  },
  {
    "id": "c068",
    "name": "Miscellaneous – Phone number",
    "text": "Our phone number is 312-491-7300,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c069",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Definition",
    "text": "WAIVER OF JURY TRIAL AND ARBITRATION PROVISION: Arbitration is a process in which persons with a dispute: (a) waive their rights to file a lawsuit and proceed in court and to have a jury vial to resolve their disputes; and (b) agrec, instead, to submit their disputes to a neutral third person (an “arbitrator”) for a decision."
  },
  {
    "id": "c070",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Evidence opportunity",
    "text": "Each party to the dispute has an opportunity to present some evidence to the arbitrator,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c071",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Discovery",
    "text": "Pre-arbitration discovery may be limited."
  },
  {
    "id": "c072",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Nature of proceedings",
    "text": "Arbitration proceedings are private and less formal than court trials."
  },
  {
    "id": "c073",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Binding decision",
    "text": "The arbitrator will issue a final and binding decision resolving the dispute, which may be enforced as a court judgment,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c074",
    "name": "Arbitration Provision – Judicial review",
    "text": "A court rarcly overturns an arbitrator’s decision."
  },
  {
    "id": "c075",
    "name": "Paragraph 1 — Definition of “dispute”",
    "text": "1. For purposes of this Waiver of Jury Trial and Arbitration Provision (hercinafler the “Arbitration Provision”), the words “dispute” and “disputes” are given the broadest possible meaning and include, without limitation (a) all claims, disputes, or controversies arising from or relating directly or indirectly to the signing of this Arbitration Provision, Ue validity and scope of this Arbitration Provision and any claim or attempt to set aside this Arbitration Provision; (b) all federal or state law claims, disputes or controversics, arising from or relating directly or indirectly to this Agreement(including the Arbilration Provision), the information you gave us before entering into this Disclosure Statement, and/or any past and/or future claims or disputes between you and us and/or any Lender who provides you with a loan as a result of our services (the “Lender”), (c) all counterclaims, cross-claims and third party claims; (d) all common law claims, based upon contract, tort, fraud, or other intentional torts; (¢) all claims based upon a violation of any state or federal constitution, statule or regulation; (f) all claims asserted by us against you, including claims for money damages to collect any sum we claim you owe us and/or the Lender; (g) all claims asserted by you individually against us and/or any of our employees, agents, directors, officers, shareholders, managers, members, parent Company or affiliated entities (hereinaNer collectively referred to as “related third parties”), including claims for money damages and/or equitable or injunctive relief; (h) all claims asserted on your behalf by another person, (1) all claims asserted by you as a private attorney general, as a representative and member of a class of persons, or in any ather representative capacity, against us and/or related third parties (hereinafter reterred to as “Representative Claims\"); and/or (j) all claims arising from or relating directly or indirectly to the disclosure by us or related third partics of any non-public personal information about you,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c076",
    "name": "2(a). Jury-trial waiver",
    "text": "(a) YOU ARE GIVING UP YOUR RIC¢ TO HAVE A TRIAL BY JURY TO RESOLV — VY DISPUTE ALLEGED AGAINST US, THE LENDER AND/OR OUR/ITS = RELATED THIRD PARTIES;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c077",
    "name": "2(b). Court-trial waiver",
    "text": "(vp) YOU ARE GIVING UP YOUR RIGHT TO HAVE A COURT, OTHER THAN A SMALL CLAIMS TRIBUNAL, RESOLVE ANY DISPUTE ALLEGED AGAINST — US, THE LENDER AND/OR OURATS RELATED THIRD PARTIES; and"
  },
  {
    "id": "c078",
    "name": "2(c). Representative and class waiver",
    "text": "(c) YOU ARE GIVING UP YOUR RIGHT TO SERVE AS A REPRESENTATIVE, AS A PRIVATE ATTORNEY GENERAL, OR IN ANY OTHER REPRESENTATIVE CAPACITY, OR TO PARTICIPATE AS A MEMBER OF A CLASS OF CLAIMANTS, IN ANY LAWSUIT FILED AGAINST US, THE LENDER AND/OR OUR/AITS RELATED THIRD PARTIES."
  },
  {
    "id": "c079",
    "name": "2(c). Consolidation waiver",
    "text": "YOUR DISPUTE MAY NOT BE CONSOLIDATED WITH THE DISPUTE OF ANY OTHER PERSON(S) FOR ANY PURPOSE(S),"
  },
  {
    "id": "c080",
    "name": "3. Individual arbitration",
    "text": "3. Except as provided in Paragraph 6 below, all disputes including any Representative Claims against us, the Lender and/or our/its related third parties shall be resolved by binding arbitration only on an individual basis with you."
  },
  {
    "id": "c081",
    "name": "3. No class arbitration",
    "text": "THEREFORE, THE ARBITRATOR SHALL NOT CONDUCT CLASS ARBITRATION; THAT IS, THE ARBITRATOR SHALL NOT ALLOW YOU TO SERVE AS A REPRESENTATIVE, AS A PRIVATE ATTORNEY GENERAL, OR IN ANY OTHER REPRESENTATIVE CAPACITY FOR OTHERS IN THE ARBITRATION."
  },
  {
    "id": "c082",
    "name": "3. Court determination of class waiver",
    "text": "Notwithstanding any other provision herein to the contrary, the validity, effect, and enforceability of this waiver of class action lawsuit and class-wide arbitration shall be determined solely by a court of competent jurisdiction and not by the arbitrator."
  },
  {
    "id": "c083",
    "name": "3. Class-waiver fallback",
    "text": "If the arbitrator fails or refuses to abide by the class-wide arbitration waiver and the court refuses to enforce the class-wide arbitration waiver, the parties agree that the dispute will proceed in court under applicable court rules and procedures, following all appeals, if any, of the court's decision."
  },
  {
    "id": "c084",
    "name": "4. Election of arbitration",
    "text": "4, Upon the election by you, us, or Lender, any dispute shall be resolved by binding arbitration in accordance with this arbitration provision and the rules of the arbitration organization that is sclected."
  },
  {
    "id": "c085",
    "name": "4. Arbitration demand",
    "text": "Either you, we, or Lender, as applicable, may give written notice to the other of an intention to require arbitration of the other party's dispute at any time, even if the other party has begun a lawsuit."
  },
  {
    "id": "c086",
    "name": "4. Judgment exception",
    "text": "If a judgment has been entered in a lawsuit regarding a dispute, however, then neither we, Lender, nor you ean demand arbitration on the matters included in the judgment."
  },
  {
    "id": "c087",
    "name": "4. Arbitrator selection",
    "text": "Affer notice by either party to the other, you may select the arbitration organization of your choice from: American Arbitration Association, 335 Madison Avenue, New York, NY 10017, www.adr.org, (800) 778-7879; JAMS 1920 Main Street, Suite 300, Irvine, CA 92614, jamsadr.com, 800-352-5267; or any other arbitrator (including an attamey, retired judge, or an arbitrator registered and in good standing with an arbitration association) reasonably satisfactory to us."
  },
  {
    "id": "c088",
    "name": "4. Failure to select arbitrator",
    "text": "[f you do not select an arbitrator within 20 days after notice, we shall be entitled to select one."
  },
  {
    "id": "c089",
    "name": "4. Court appointment of arbitrator",
    "text": "If the named organization will not conduct the arbitration according to this provision, or if we are not able to agree on another arbitrator, you agree that we may ask any court of competent jurisdiction to appoint an arbitrator to conduct the arbitration in accordance with this arbitration agreement."
  },
  {
    "id": "c090",
    "name": "4. Arbitrator-selection rules",
    "text": "‘The individual arbitrator shall be chosen in accordance with the rules of the selected arbitration organization, but if that organization or arbitrator has no published rules, then in accordance with the Rules of the AAA for Consumer Arbitrations,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c091",
    "name": "4. Class-action organizations excluded",
    "text": "You, we, and Lender agree that any arbitration organization that permits class actions in arbitration may not be selected to arbitrate disputes,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c092",
    "name": "4. Advancement of arbitration fees",
    "text": "If you ask us fo, we or Lender, as applicable, will advance all or part of the arbitration filing, administrative, and/or hearing fees required for the arbitration, up to $1000;"
  },
  {
    "id": "c093",
    "name": "4. Allocation of arbitration fees",
    "text": "the arbitrator will decide whether we, Lender, or you, as applicable, will ultimately be responsible to pay those fees."
  },
  {
    "id": "c094",
    "name": "4. Reimbursement cap",
    "text": "In no event will you be required to reimburse us or Lender for any arbitration filing, administrative and/or hearing fees in an amount greater than what your court costs would have been if the dispute had been resolved in a state court with jurisdiction."
  },
  {
    "id": "c095",
    "name": "4. Compliance intent",
    "text": "IC is the intention of CAB and Lender to comply with applicable law,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c096",
    "name": "4. Rights limited by law",
    "text": "In cach and every instance, CAB’s and Lender's respective rights are limited by applicable law (to the extent they may not be lawfully waived), construed so as to comply with applicable laws, and CAB’s and Lender's rights may not be exercised except to the extent permitted by applicable law."
  },
  {
    "id": "c097",
    "name": "4. Lawful charges",
    "text": "No charge or receipt by CAB or Lender, or any other person on CAB’s or Lender's behalf, is intended to exceed lawful amounts."
  },
  {
    "id": "c098",
    "name": "4. Unlawful excess",
    "text": "I an unlawful excess occurs, it will be applied as a credit or otherwise refunded, and the rate or amount involved will automatically be rcduced to the maximum lawful rate or amount."
